msgstr "Bombastycznie!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND"
msgid "I don't like how it's looking at me."
msgstr "Nie podoba mi się, jak na mnie patrzy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG"
msgid "It looks very lifelike."
msgstr "Wygląda bardzo realistycznie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.GARLIC"
