msgstr "Pomaga na oddech jak mało co."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED"
