msgstr "A świstak siedzi..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE"
