msgid "I don't think it's ready just yet."
msgstr "Chyba jeszcze nie jest gotowy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC"
msgid "Maybe I could ask her to make me a kitchen timer..."
msgstr "Może bym ją poprosił, żeby mi zrobiła minutnik..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING"
msgid "I don't think it's ready just yet."
msgstr "Chyba jeszcze nie jest gotowy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm starting to think Mme. Wanda has a bit of pent up aggression..."
msgstr "Zaczynam podejrzewać, że madame Wanda tłumi w sobie agresję..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE"
msgid "A simple way to weigh!"
msgstr "Prosty sposób na sprawdzenie wagi!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE"
msgid "A rich pastry with a sweet fruity filling."
msgstr "Ciasto ze słodkim owocowym nadzieniem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS"
msgid "Je m'excuse, I did not bring any crackers."
msgstr "Je m’excuse, nie przyniosłem krakersów."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT"
msgid "What a fine chapeau!"
msgstr "Jaki elegancki chapeau!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE"
msgid "Wonderful!"
msgstr "Wspaniale!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED"
msgid "Could use tahini and mint..."
msgstr "Przydałoby się trochę tahini i mięty..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I could make a fine dessert with you!"
msgstr "Zrobiłbym z ciebie pyszny deser!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS"
msgid "Future ingredients, just waiting to be grown!"
msgstr "Będą z nich składniki. Trzeba tylko poczekać, aż urosną!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POND"
msgid "I can't see the bottom..."
msgstr "Nie widzę dna..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL"
msgid "Anguille."
msgstr "Anguille."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH"
msgid "Poisson!"
msgstr "Poisson!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE"
msgid "I can't see the bottom..."
msgstr "Nie widzę dna..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POOP"
msgid "The end result of a fine meal."
msgstr "Efekt końcowy porządnego posiłku."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM"
msgid "It has greatly improved my culinary adventures."
msgstr "Znacząco wzbogacił moje kulinarne przygody."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "The flavors need time to meld."
msgstr "Smaki potrzebują czasu, żeby się połączyć."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "I threw that meal together!"
msgstr "Po prostu wrzuciłem wszystko razem!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE"
msgid "Pickup! Oh, old habits..."
msgstr "Odbiór! Ach, stare nawyki..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY"
msgid "I would never leave home without it!"
msgstr "Nigdzie się bez niego nie ruszam!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC"
msgid "What new culinary adventures shall we undertake, old friend?"
msgstr "Jakież nowe kulinarne przygody czekają na horyzoncie, mój stary przyjacielu?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM"
msgid "Most convenient!"
msgstr "Jakże wygodne!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE"
msgid "Pickup! Oh, old habits..."
msgstr "Odbiór! Ach, stare nawyki..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC"
msgid "Fresh spices! Oh, how I have missed you!"
msgstr "Przyprawy! Ach, ależ mi was brakowało!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT"
msgid "It looks very cozy."
msgstr "Wygląda bardzo przytulnie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM"
msgid "All rolled up like a crepe."
msgstr "Zwinięty jak naleśnik."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTATO"
msgid "Ah, the mighty potato!"
msgstr "Ach, przepotężny ziemniak!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK"
msgid "I suppose all that lifting works up quite an appetite."
msgstr "To całe dźwiganie działa pobudzająco na apetyt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE"
msgid "It came out just right."
msgstr "Wyszło idealnie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO"
msgid "Junk food can be as enjoyable as anything gourmet."
msgstr "Niezdrowe jedzenie bywa tak samo smaczne, jak wykwintne dania."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED"
msgid "Golden brown. Simplicity at its finest."
msgstr "Złocistobrązowy. Prostota w pełnej krasie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Ah, you can never go wrong with a potato!"
msgstr "Ach, ziemniaki to zawsze dobry wybór!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS"
msgid "What fresh ingredients will grow from these?"
msgstr "Ciekawe co z tego wyrośnie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN"
msgid "Nature. Tamed."
msgstr "Okiełznana przyroda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE"
msgid "I would not feed this to my worst enemies. Or would I..."
msgstr "Nie dałbym tego nawet swoim najgorszym wrogom. Chyba że..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY"
msgid "J'accuse! You are no honest sailor!"
msgstr "J’accuse! Nie jesteś uczciwym żeglarzem!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY"
msgid "It's completely empty, I'm afraid."
msgstr "Zupełnie pusta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC"
msgid "To make the finest ingredients, our plants need the finest care."
msgstr "Nasze rośliny potrzebują najlepszej opieki, by dawały najlepsze składniki."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE"
msgid "You should teach your crew better manners, monsieur."
msgstr "Mógłby pan nauczyć załogi lepszych manier, monsieur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Hm, I don't think I've cooked one of those before."
msgstr "Hm, chyba nigdy czegoś takiego nie przyrządzałem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD"
msgid "What a cute little morsel!"
msgstr "Ależ uroczy smakołyk!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING"
msgid "I think it's asleep."
msgstr "Chyba śpi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN"
msgid "I'm the pumpking of the world!"
msgstr "Tak wiele przepisów, tak mało czasu!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER"
msgid "Ah yes. I can use this."
msgstr "O, tak. To się na pewno przyda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE"
msgid "I've outdone myself this time."
msgstr "Przeszedłem samego siebie!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE"
msgid "Simple and classic."
msgstr "Proste i klasyczne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED"
msgid "Could use some pie crust and nutmeg..."
msgstr "Przydałoby się trochę kruchego ciasta i gałki muszkatołowej..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN"
msgid "Trick 'r' neat!"
msgstr "Psikus albo psikus!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "You would make for a lovely pie."
msgstr "Zrobiłbym z ciebie pyszne ciasto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS"
msgid "Future ingredients, just waiting to be grown!"
msgstr "Będą z nich składniki. Trzeba tylko poczekać, aż urosną!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG"
msgid "It's a relief to practice on something that won't hit me back."
msgstr "Dobrze poćwiczyć na czymś, co nie może mi oddać."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE"
msgid "My, I've never seen anything shine so brightly."
msgstr "Nigdy nie widziałem, żeby coś świeciło tak jasno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET"
msgid "I must be crazy to fool around with this."
msgstr "Chyba jestem nienormalny, żeby się tym bawić."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM"
msgid "It holds deep secrets."
msgstr "Skrywa wiele sekretów."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE"
msgid "It's a purple stone eye."
msgstr "Fioletowe kamienne oko."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC"
msgid "I haven't had rabbit in awhile..."
msgstr "Dawno nie jadłem królika..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD"
msgid "Your little heart is beating so fast."
msgstr "Twoje małe serduszko bije tak szybko..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT"
msgid "Cute topper."
msgstr "Urocze, jak wisienka na torcie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Thump twice if you are fat and juicy."
msgstr "Gdzie się chowasz, mój smaczny kolego?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING"
msgid "What a pity rabbit season has ended."
msgstr "Szkoda, że sezon na króliki się skończył..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "That was no carrot!"
msgstr "To nie była marchewka!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Do my eyes deceive me?"
msgstr "Czyżby wzrok mnie zwodził?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN"
msgid "Do rabbits have a taste for music?"
msgstr "Jakie są królicze smaki w kwestii muzyki?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST"
msgid "A cellar!"
msgstr "Piwniczka!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN"
msgid "They are not trying to cuddle."
msgstr "Oni nie próbują się przytulać."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR"
msgid "Made from real rabbit antler."
msgstr "Zrobiona z najprawdziwszego króliczego poroża."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE"
msgid "It is tough, even for stew."
msgstr "Twarda sztuka, nawet na potrawkę."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY"
msgid "I promise not to cook you!"
msgstr "Przysięgam, że cię nie ugotuję!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE"
msgid "A gentle creature. Hopefully."
msgstr "Łagodna istota. Mam nadzieję."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT"
msgid "For a foggy Paris evening."
msgstr "Na mgliste paryskie wieczory."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT"
msgid "Better than a newspaper."
msgstr "Lepsze to niż gazeta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT"
msgid "It measures nothing now..."
msgstr "Nic już nie zmierzy..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "It measures moisture in the clouds."
msgstr "Mierzy zawartość wody w chmurach."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE"
msgid "A veritable village of vegetables!"
msgstr "Warzywna mieszanka bogów!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RAZOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RAZOR"
msgid "If only I had aftershave."
msgstr "Szkoda, że nie mam płynu po goleniu..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD"
msgid "Now where have I heard that before?"
msgstr "Hm, gdzie ja to słyszałem?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO"
msgid "Reminds me of fun times."
msgstr "Przypomina mi o czasach, gdy dobrze się bawiłem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST"
msgid "A feast for the ears!"
msgstr "Uczta dla uszu!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER"
msgid "A feast for the ears!"
msgstr "Uczta dla uszu!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN"
msgid "A feast for the ears!"
msgstr "Uczta dla uszu!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE"
msgid "What a sweet sound it makes."
msgstr "Co za słodka melodia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK"
msgid "What a sweet sound it makes."
msgstr "Co za słodka melodia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS"
msgid "A feast for the ears!"
msgstr "Uczta dla uszu!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END"
msgid "A feast for the ears!"
msgstr "Uczta dla uszu!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS"
msgid "It really sets the mood."
msgstr "Naprawdę tworzy odpowiedni nastrój."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN"
msgid "What a sweet sound it makes."
msgstr "Co za słodka melodia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE"
msgid "What a sweet sound it makes."
msgstr "Co za słodka melodia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.REDGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.REDGEM"
msgid "A deep fire burns within."
msgstr "Widać wewnątrz płonący ogień."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN"
msgid "I do like festivals like this."
msgstr "Podobają mi się takie święta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE"
msgid "It looks a bit like an eye with a gem inside, non?"
msgstr "Wygląda jak klejnot z okiem w środku, non?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH"
msgid "How nice it is to have luck on my side!"
msgstr "Miło jest mieć trochę szczęścia!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP"
msgid "Could use cream and salt... And less poison."
msgstr "Przydałby się trochę śmietany i soli... i mniej trucizny."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Perhaps I could make a good soup."
msgstr "Może nadałby się do zupy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
