#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLREPAIREDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLREPAIREDHAT"
