msgstr "Możemy udawać kogoś innego!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MASK_HALFWITHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MASK_HALFWITHAT"
