#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE"
