#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT"
msgid "Mum always said I should take a cap with me."
msgstr "Mama zawsze powtarzała, żebym brał czapkę."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT"
msgid "How come everything turns to ashes? It's sad."
msgstr "Dlaczego wszystko obraca się zawsze w proch? To smutne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "How hot is it, Mr. Thermal Measurer?"
msgstr "Czy jest ciepło, panie Termoodmierzaczu?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
msgid "It fills us with peace and joy!"
msgstr "Napełnia nas radością i spokojem!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING"
msgid "We can't wait til it's done!"
msgstr "Nie możemy się doczekać, aż będzie gotowe!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING"
msgid "Should we set the table while it's cooking?"
msgstr "Powinniśmy w międzyczasie nakryć stół?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY"
msgid "It's ready to eat!"
msgstr "Gotowe do jedzenia!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Woah, that oven's huge!"
msgstr "Łał! Ten piekarnik jest ogromny!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1"
msgid "I won't eat it. It's our friend now."
msgstr "Nie zjem go. Jest teraz naszym przyjacielem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2"
msgid "Icy icy icing!"
msgstr "Lukier najlepszy!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3"
msgid "Eat twenty candy canes! There's no candy shame!"
msgstr "Nam przydałoby się więcej!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4"
msgid "Yuck! What is that??"
msgstr "Fuj! Co to w ogóle jest?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5"
msgid "Haha, Wendy! Watch our Woodie impression!"
msgstr "Ha, ha! Wendy! Patrz, jak udajemy Woodiego!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6"
msgid "Where are the plums?"
msgstr "A gdzie śliwki?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7"
msgid "Apple juice?! Yes!!"
msgstr "Sok jabłkowy? O tak!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8"
msgid "It makes our claws and tummy so warm."
msgstr "Rozgrzewa pazury i brzuszek."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9"
msgid "It's really, really good!"
msgstr "Naprawdę dobry!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT"
msgid "Can we get a boost? We can't reach the treetop."
msgstr "Może nas ktoś podnieść? Nie sięgniemy na czubek."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS"
msgid "Wow, that one looks great!"
msgstr "Ooo, ta jest niezła!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE"
msgid "Not so scary when they're like this."
msgstr "W tej formie wzbudza nieco mniejszą grozę."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE"
msgid "Huh. It kinda looks...goaty!"
msgstr "Wygląda jakoś tak... kozio!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT"
