#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY"
