#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING"
