#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD"
