msgstr "Nie zapali się, więc mnie nie interesi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED"
