msgstr "Okej, więc to nie wypaliło."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN"
