#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC"
