msgstr "Poświęcaj zdrowie, by tworzyć krzaki porzeczek."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BERRYBUSHCRAFTING_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BERRYBUSHCRAFTING_TITLE"
