#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wall_wood_ornate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wall_wood_ornate"
msgid "The contents of one's bookshelf can speak volumes about their character."
msgstr "Pokaż mi swoją biblioteczkę, a powiem ci, kim jesteś."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wall_wood_ornateitem
