#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.lucy.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.lucy.1"
msgid "You don't need that sssssecond-rate axe..."
msgstr "Nie potrzebujeszzz tej kiepssskiej sssiekiery…"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.lucy.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.lucy.2"
msgid "We could do ssssso much more without that old axe weighing you down..."
msgstr "Moglibyśśśmy tyle osssiągnąć, gdyby ta ssstara sssiekiera cię nie ssspowalniała…"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.lucy.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.lucy.3"
msgid "Best to sssssever your connection with that old blade of yours."
msgstr "Zerwij kontakt z tym ssstarym ossstrzem."

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.lucy.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.lucy.4"
msgid "Who needsssss that old axe when you have me?"
msgstr "Na co komu ssstara sssiekiera, kiedy maszzz mnie?"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.1"
msgid "Devassssstation to vegetation!"
msgstr "Śśśśśmierć wegetacji!"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.10"
msgid "Let nothing be ssssspared!"
msgstr "Nie oszzzczędzaj niczego!"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.11"
msgid "Enjoying yourssssself, {mortal}?"
msgstr "Śśśmiertelniku, dobrze sssię bawiszzz?"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.2"
msgid "Cut them down, cut them all down!"
msgstr "Zetnij je, zetnij je wszystkie!"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.3"
msgid "There is no essssscaping my blade!"
msgstr "Nic nie umknie mojemu ossstrzu!"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.4"
msgid "Cut... slash... consume... yesssss..."
msgstr "Tnij… sssssiekaj… pochłaniaj… tak…"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.5"
msgid "The world is oursssss for the reaping."
msgstr "Nadszzzedł czasss żniw."

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.6"
msgid "Don't hold back..."
msgstr "Nie powssstrzymuj sssię…"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.7"
msgid "Let's cut right to it, ssssshall we?"
msgstr "Nie ucinaj sssssobie drzemki, czasssss sssssiekać!"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.8"
msgid "It's time for the harvessssst."
msgstr "Czasssss na żniwa!"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.onharvest.9"
msgid "Everything will fall before usssss!"
msgstr "Wszzzyssstko upadnie przed naszzzą mocą!"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.1"
msgid "You want to cut and ssssslice, yes you do!"
msgstr "Chcesz ciąć i sssssiekać, o tak!"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.10"
msgid "I've been accused of having a rather sssssharp tongue."
msgstr "Podobno mam dośśśśść cięty język."

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.11"
msgid "We make a good team, no matter how you ssssslice it."
msgstr "Zgrany z nasssss duet. Trafiła kosssssa na kamień."

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.12
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.12"
msgid "I hunger for the sssssilent screams of vegetation..."
msgstr "Łaknę cichych krzyków rośśśśślinnośśśśści."

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.13
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.13"
msgid "With my razor-sharp wit and your... mobility, we're unssssstoppable!"
msgstr "Dzięki mojemu ossssstremu temperamentowi i twojej… mobilnośśśśści jesteśśśśśmy niepokonani!"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.14
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.14"
msgid "We're all jussssst tools for a greater purpose, aren't we?"
msgstr "Jesteśśśśśmy tylko narzędziami sssssłużącymi wyższym celom, czyż nie?"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.15
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.15"
msgid "Lay wassssste to the grass, then the bushes... after that, who knows?"
msgstr "Połóż kresssss trawie, potem krzewom… a potem… kto wie!"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.2"
msgid "The ssssseeds were planted long ago, now reap the rewards."
msgstr "Ziarna zasssssiano dawno temu, teraz czasssss zebrać żniwa."

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.3"
msgid "Your palms are sssssweating, {mortal}, you're losing your grip."
msgstr "Dłonie ci sssssię pocą, śśśśśmiertelniku. Tracisz kontrolę."

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.4"
msgid "You need a sssssharp wit for this job."
msgstr "Do tej roboty potrzeba sssssilnej woli."

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.5"
msgid "What'sssss wrong, {mortal}? Not cut out for this?"
msgstr "Co jessssst, śśśśśmiertelniku? Brak ci przekonania?"

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.6"
msgid "You and I are going to do sssssuch great things together."
msgstr "Ty i ja dokonamy ssssstrasznych czynów."

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.7"
msgid "I think I was a farmer once, before I ssssshed my skin."
msgstr "Kiedyś uprawiałam rolę, ale później zrzuciłam ssssskórę."

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.8"
msgid "You can hear me, can't you, {mortal}? You're ssssstarting to understand."
msgstr "Sssssłyszysz mnie, prawda, śśśśśmiertelniku? Zaczynasz rozumieć."

#. STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE_TALK.overtime.9"
msgid "I can sssssee all the dark corners of your mind, {mortal}."
msgstr "Widzę ciemnośśśść w twoim umyśśśśśle, śśśśśmiertelniku."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GET_MORE_GESTALTCAGES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GET_MORE_GESTALTCAGES.1"
msgid "Do you have another sample?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GET_MORE_GESTALTCAGES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GET_MORE_GESTALTCAGES.2"
msgid "Hm, try getting me another."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GET_MORE_GESTALTCAGES.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GET_MORE_GESTALTCAGES.3"
msgid "I need a more suitable entity!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GET_MORE_GESTALTCAGES.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GET_MORE_GESTALTCAGES.4"
msgid "Find me a power source!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOTTAGO1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOTTAGO1"
msgid "Aha! This selenological anomaly can only mean one thing!"
msgstr "Aha! Ta anomalia selenologiczna może znaczyć tylko jedno!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOTTAGO2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOTTAGO2"
msgid "Now is my chance!"
msgstr "Teraz mam szansę!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOTTOHINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOTTOHINT.1"
msgid "Just a bit more research... I'm close, I'm sure of it!"
msgstr "Trochę więcej badań… Już prawie mi się udało, jestem pewien!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOTTOHINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOTTOHINT.2"
msgid "A few more samples, yes, that's what I need..."
msgstr "Jeszcze kilka próbek. Tak, właśnie tego potrzebuję…"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOTTOHINT.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOTTOHINT.3"
msgid "Now where did I leave my notes? I'm sure they were somewhere around here..."
msgstr "Zaraz, gdzie ja zostawiłem moje notatki? Jestem pewien, że gdzieś tutaj były…"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOTTOHINT.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOTTOHINT.4"
msgid "Onto the next experiment!"
msgstr "Czas na kolejny eksperyment!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOTTOHINT.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOTTOHINT.5"
msgid "Progress waits for no one!"
msgstr "Postęp nie czeka na nikogo!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_EMPTY_GESTALTCAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_EMPTY_GESTALTCAGE.1"
msgid "It's empty."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_GESTALTCAGE_GOOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_GESTALTCAGE_GOOD.1"
msgid "Hm, not quite powerful enough, but I can use it."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_GESTALTCAGE_GOOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_GESTALTCAGE_GOOD.2"
msgid "I'll take it, but there's a special one I'm looking for."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_GESTALTCAGE_GOOD_BIGONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_GESTALTCAGE_GOOD_BIGONE.1"
msgid "Yes! A very good one! Finally!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_GESTALTCAGE_GOOD_BIGONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_GESTALTCAGE_GOOD_BIGONE.2"
msgid "You've got it! This will do nicely!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_GESTALTCAGE_GOOD_BIGONE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_GESTALTCAGE_GOOD_BIGONE.3"
msgid "Excellent, this is the one I've been waiting for!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_GESTALTCAGE_NOLONGERNEEDED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_GESTALTCAGE_NOLONGERNEEDED.1"
msgid "Hm, see if you can capture me another variety."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_GESTALTCAGE_NOLONGERNEEDED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_GESTALTCAGE_NOLONGERNEEDED.2"
msgid "I have enough of these. I need something special, something more... powerful."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_MAPSCROLL_BAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_MAPSCROLL_BAD.1"
msgid "This is no good. It has to have my... an island on it."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_MAPSCROLL_BAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_MAPSCROLL_BAD.2"
msgid "This map is useless. That crab will only move to another island."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_MAPSCROLL_BAD.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_MAPSCROLL_BAD.3"
msgid "Try again. Bring me a map to the primate island."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_MAPSCROLL_GOOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_MAPSCROLL_GOOD.1"
msgid "This will do. Just few minor edits... Perfect."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_MAPSCROLL_GOOD_FINISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_MAPSCROLL_GOOD_FINISH.1"
msgid "Run along and give it to that crab."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_MAPSCROLL_NOLONGERNEEDED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_MAPSCROLL_NOLONGERNEEDED.1"
msgid "Stop bringing me maps! That crab is gone!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_NOT_GESTALTCAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_NOT_GESTALTCAGE.1"
msgid "This is not what I need. Use a Phasmo-Encapsulator and capture an appropriate entity."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_NOT_MAPSCROLL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_NOT_MAPSCROLL.1"
msgid "No... no. We need a map to move that crab."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_NOT_MAPSCROLL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_GOT_NOT_MAPSCROLL.2"
msgid "What is this? We need a map for that crab!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_JUNK_YARD_OCCUPIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_JUNK_YARD_OCCUPIED.1"
msgid "Too crowded here for my work. I'll come back later"
msgstr "Za dużo tu ludzi. Nie da się pracować. Wrócę później."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_MAPSCROLL_TRICKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_MAPSCROLL_TRICKER.1"
msgid "No, not me! The crab! Give it to that crab!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_MAPSCROLL_TRICKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_MAPSCROLL_TRICKER.2"
msgid "Why are you giving me this? It's for that crab."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ALL_MUTATIONS_DEFEATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ALL_MUTATIONS_DEFEATED.1"
msgid "Right. A third specimen. I did ask for another, didn't I?"
msgstr "Racja. Trzeci okaz. Prosiłem o niego, prawda?"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ALL_MUTATIONS_DEFEATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ALL_MUTATIONS_DEFEATED.2"
msgid "You dallied so long I nearly forgot!"
msgstr "Tak się ociągasz, że prawie zapomniałem!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ALL_MUTATIONS_DEFEATED.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ALL_MUTATIONS_DEFEATED.3"
msgid "For your troubles, the fruits of our research."
msgstr "Oto owoce moich badań w nagrodę za fatygę."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ALL_MUTATIONS_DEFEATED.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ALL_MUTATIONS_DEFEATED.4"
msgid "I think taking it down to the subterranean archives..."
msgstr "Chyba zabiorę to do podziemnych archiwów…"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ALL_MUTATIONS_DEFEATED.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ALL_MUTATIONS_DEFEATED.5"
msgid "Will prove most enlightening."
msgstr "To z pewnością będzie bardzo pouczające."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ANALYSIS_OVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ANALYSIS_OVER.1"
msgid "Now, if you'll excuse me, I have much to do."
msgstr "Teraz wybacz, ale mam mnóstwo pracy."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ANALYSIS_OVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ANALYSIS_OVER.2"
msgid "Farewell!"
msgstr "Żegnaj!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ANALYSIS_OVER.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ANALYSIS_OVER.3"
msgid "Until next time."
msgstr "Do następnego razu."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ANALYSIS_OVER.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ANALYSIS_OVER.4"
msgid "Best of luck to you! I must be off."
msgstr "Życzę ci powodzenia! Ja znikam."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ATTEMPT_TRADE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ATTEMPT_TRADE.1"
msgid "Is it important?"
msgstr "Czy to ważne?"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ATTEMPT_TRADE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_ATTEMPT_TRADE.2"
msgid "Quickly now, timing is critical!"
msgstr "A teraz szybko, musimy wyczuć odpowiedni moment!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_CAPTURESTART
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_CAPTURESTART"
msgid "Excellent! My little experiment was a resounding success!"
msgstr "Świetnie! Mój mały eksperyment okazał się kolosalnym sukcesem!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_CAPTURESTOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_CAPTURESTOP"
msgid "Thank you for all your hard work."
msgstr "Dziękuję za całą twoją ciężką pracę."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_CAPTURESTOP1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_CAPTURESTOP1"
msgid "This will increase the power output exponentially!"
msgstr "To spowoduje wzrost wykładniczy mocy wyjściowej!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_CAPTURESTOP2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_CAPTURESTOP2"
msgid "Now if you'll excuse me, I have much to do."
msgstr "A teraz wybacz, ale mam mnóstwo pracy."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_CAPTURESTOP3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_CAPTURESTOP3"
msgid "You and I are about to change the world!"
msgstr "Razem zmienimy świat!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_DEFEAT_ONE_MORE_MUTATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_DEFEAT_ONE_MORE_MUTATION.1"
msgid "Well done!"
msgstr "Dobra robota!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_DEFEAT_ONE_MORE_MUTATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_DEFEAT_ONE_MORE_MUTATION.2"
msgid "But perhaps one more."
msgstr "Może zajmiesz się tym jeszcze raz?"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_DEFEAT_ONE_MORE_MUTATION.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_DEFEAT_ONE_MORE_MUTATION.3"
msgid "For scientific accuracy, of course."
msgstr "Taka jest natura metody naukowej."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_DEFEAT_ONE_MORE_MUTATION.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_DEFEAT_ONE_MORE_MUTATION.4"
msgid "You understand."
msgstr "Z pewnością rozumiesz."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_DEFEAT_TWO_MORE_MUTATIONS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_DEFEAT_TWO_MORE_MUTATIONS.1"
msgid "Illuminating! It would greatly aid my research..."
msgstr "Kształcące! To bardzo pomoże w moich badaniach…"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_DEFEAT_TWO_MORE_MUTATIONS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_DEFEAT_TWO_MORE_MUTATIONS.2"
msgid "If you could repeat this exemplary performance..."
msgstr "Gdyby możliwe było powtórzenie tego wspaniałego wyczynu…"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_DEFEAT_TWO_MORE_MUTATIONS.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_DEFEAT_TWO_MORE_MUTATIONS.3"
msgid "With another specimen displaying similar mutations."
msgstr "Z kolejnym okazem, który przeszedł podobną mutację."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_EXPERIMENT_DONE_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_EXPERIMENT_DONE_1"
msgid "It's done!"
msgstr "Gotowe!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_EXPERIMENT_DONE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_EXPERIMENT_DONE_2"
msgid "Take this, you'll need it for what we have to do."
msgstr "Weź to, będziesz tego potrzebować."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_EXPERIMENT_FAIL_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_EXPERIMENT_FAIL_1"
msgid "Balderdash! The containment has failed!"
msgstr "Do diaska! Izolacja zawiodła!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_EXPERIMENT_FAIL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_EXPERIMENT_FAIL_2"
msgid "Back to my notes again..."
msgstr "Wracamy do moich notatek..."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_GOT_ENOUGH_GESTALTCAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_GOT_ENOUGH_GESTALTCAGE.1"
msgid "Enough of these."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_GOT_ENOUGH_GESTALTCAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_GOT_ENOUGH_GESTALTCAGE.2"
msgid "We need something far more powerful."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_GOT_ENOUGH_GESTALTCAGE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_GOT_ENOUGH_GESTALTCAGE.3"
msgid "I wonder where we can find one..."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_LUNARGUARDIANINCOMING
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_LUNARGUARDIANINCOMING"
msgid "Hm, seems we've angered the lunar being in collecting too many of its little friends."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MEETING
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MEETING"
msgid "You! Of course!"
msgstr "Ty! No oczywiście!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MEETING_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MEETING_2"
msgid "Quick, take these!"
msgstr "Szybko, weź to!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MEETING_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MEETING_3"
msgid "I'll be needing some assistance shortly."
msgstr "Niedługo będę potrzebować pomocy."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MEETING_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MEETING_4"
msgid "Find me when you are sufficiently prepared."
msgstr "Znajdź mnie, gdy odpowiednio się przygotujesz."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MEETING_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MEETING_5"
msgid "Now, to find the source of that reading..."
msgstr "Teraz trzeba znaleźć źródło tego odczytu..."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUMBLE_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUMBLE_1.1"
msgid "It's close by now..."
msgstr "Jest już blisko..."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUMBLE_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUMBLE_1.2"
msgid "If I can just find..."
msgstr "Gdybym tylko znalazł..."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUMBLE_1.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUMBLE_1.3"
msgid "If my hypothesis is correct..."
msgstr "Jeżeli moja hipoteza jest słuszna..."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUMBLE_1.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUMBLE_1.4"
msgid "It's here... somewhere."
msgstr "Jest... gdzieś tutaj."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATION_DEFEATED_AFTER_TASK_COMPLETED1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATION_DEFEATED_AFTER_TASK_COMPLETED1.1"
msgid "I have all the data I require from this creature."
msgstr "Mam już wszystkie dane na temat tego stworzenia, których potrzebuję."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATION_DEFEATED_AFTER_TASK_COMPLETED1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATION_DEFEATED_AFTER_TASK_COMPLETED1.2"
msgid "However... I suppose I mustn't let your efforts go unrewarded."
msgstr "Niemniej jednak… chyba muszę nagrodzić cię za starania."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATION_DEFEATED_AFTER_TASK_COMPLETED2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATION_DEFEATED_AFTER_TASK_COMPLETED2.1"
msgid "Still at it, are you? I must commend your zeal for research."
msgstr "Wciąż nie przestajesz? Jestem pod wrażeniem twojego zapału do badań."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATION_DEFEATED_AFTER_TASK_COMPLETED2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATION_DEFEATED_AFTER_TASK_COMPLETED2.2"
msgid "Here, a contribution to your continued studies."
msgstr "Proszę, to mój wkład w twój projekt badawczy."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATION_DEFEATED_AFTER_TASK_COMPLETED3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATION_DEFEATED_AFTER_TASK_COMPLETED3.1"
msgid "I'm afraid we have nothing more to gain from analyzing this poor creature."
msgstr "Obawiam się, że nie uzyskamy nic więcej z analizy tego biednego stworzenia."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATION_DEFEATED_AFTER_TASK_COMPLETED3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATION_DEFEATED_AFTER_TASK_COMPLETED3.2"
msgid "Take this, as a token of my gratitude for your efforts."
msgstr "Proszę, to mój wyraz wdzięczności za twoje starania."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_NOTTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_NOTTHAT"
msgid "Don't waste my time."
msgstr "Nie marnuj mojego czasu."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_NOT_THIS_TOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_NOT_THIS_TOOL.1"
msgid "No no, that's not what I'm looking for!"
msgstr "Nie, nie, to nie tego szukam."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_NOT_THIS_TOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_NOT_THIS_TOOL.2"
msgid "This isn't the right one, the other one!"
msgstr "To nie to, potrzebuję tamtego!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_NO_WAY1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_NO_WAY1.1"
msgid "Blast, I lost the signal."
msgstr "Niech to, straciłem sygnał."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_NO_WAY2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_NO_WAY2.1"
msgid "I must have miscalculated."
msgstr "Musiałem pomylić się w obliczeniach."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_NO_WAY3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_NO_WAY3.1"
msgid "Come find me again once I've made some preparations."
msgstr "Wróć do mnie, gdy zakończę przygotowania."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.1"
msgid "Incredible! It's just as I surmised!"
msgstr "Niesamowite! Właśnie tak, jak przypuszczałem!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.10"
msgid "If I could just locate one..."
msgstr "Gdybym tylko potrafił takie coś odnaleźć…"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.11"
msgid "A crystalline shard, with the correct properties..."
msgstr "Krystaliczny odłamek o odpowiednich właściwościach…"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.2"
msgid "If I could just push its output a bit further..."
msgstr "Gdybym tylko mógł odrobinę zwiększyć moc wyjściową…"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.3"
msgid "Oh yes, this could really be something, with one small addition..."
msgstr "O tak, to mogłoby być coś. Trzeba tylko coś dodać…"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.4"
msgid "A small crystalline structure might just do the trick."
msgstr "Mała krystaliczna struktura może się nadać."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.5"
msgid "Yes, I'm positive a shard of crystal would work..."
msgstr "Tak, jestem pewien, że odłamek kryształu by zadziałał…"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.6"
msgid "If it had the right translucency..."
msgstr "Gdyby przejrzystość była odpowiednia…"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.7"
msgid "And the correct shape..."
msgstr "A kształt właściwy…"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.8"
msgid "And lunar origin..."
msgstr "No i pochodziłby z księżyca…"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_REQUEST.9"
msgid "Hmmm..."
msgstr "Hmmm..."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_START.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_START.1"
msgid "This is it, it must be contained."
msgstr "To właśnie to. Musimy to schwytać."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_START.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_START.2"
msgid "I'll need your assistance, we must contain it before it's gone!"
msgstr "Potrzebuję twojej pomocy, musimy to schwytać, zanim zniknie."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_STORMPASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_STORMPASS"
msgid "Balderdash, my connection is fading!"
msgstr "Do diaska, tracę połączenie!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_THIS_WAY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_THIS_WAY.1"
msgid "Ahh, this way!"
msgstr "Och, tędy!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_THIS_WAY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_THIS_WAY.2"
msgid "My scans point toward this direction."
msgstr "Moje skany wskazują ten kierunek!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_THIS_WAY.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_THIS_WAY.3"
msgid "Aha, found it again!"
msgstr "Aha, znowu się udało!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_TOO_BUSY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_TOO_BUSY.1"
msgid "I'm a bit preoccupied at the moment."
msgstr "W tej chwili jestem dość zajęty."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_TOO_BUSY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_TOO_BUSY.2"
msgid "Patience if you please, this requires my full concentration."
msgstr "Proszę o cierpliwość, muszę się maksymalnie skoncentrować."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WANT_TOOL_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WANT_TOOL_1"
msgid "Quick, I need my Reticulating Buffer!"
msgstr "Szybko, potrzebuję buforu dzwonowatego!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WANT_TOOL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WANT_TOOL_2"
msgid "Someone find me a Widget Deflubber!"
msgstr "Niech ktoś znajdzie mi widżet transmisyjny!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WANT_TOOL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WANT_TOOL_3"
msgid "Has anyone seen my Grommet Scriber?"
msgstr "Czy ktoś widział mój notatnik modulacyjny?"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WANT_TOOL_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WANT_TOOL_4"
msgid "Can someone hand me the Conceptual Scrubber?"
msgstr "Czy ktoś może mi podać narzędziownik koncepcyjny?"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WANT_TOOL_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WANT_TOOL_5"
msgid "I'm certain I put the Calibrated Perceiver down here somewhere..."
msgstr "Jestem pewien, że odkładałem tu gdzieś skalibrowany podglądacz..."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_YES_THAT1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_YES_THAT1"
msgid "This is... yes, this will propel my experiments to the next level!"
msgstr "To… tak, dzięki temu mogę rozpocząć kolejny etap eksperymentu!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_YES_THAT2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_YES_THAT2"
msgid "Quickly, hand it over."
msgstr "Szybko, dawaj to."

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_YES_THIS_TOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_YES_THIS_TOOL.1"
msgid "Excellent, that's it!"
msgstr "Wyśmienicie, o to właśnie chodziło!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_YES_THIS_TOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_NPC_YES_THIS_TOOL.2"
msgid "At last! Now let's get this finished!"
msgstr "Nareszcie! A teraz dokończmy pracę!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_TOOMANYITEMS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_TOOMANYITEMS.1"
msgid "Your haste is good but I'm busy!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_TOOMANYITEMS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_TOOMANYITEMS.2"
msgid "I'm too busy to deal with you right now."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_CONSTRUCT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_CONSTRUCT.1"
msgid "You'll need to construct a Phasmo-Encapsulator to capture an energy being."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_CONSTRUCT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_CONSTRUCT.2"
msgid "Excellent! I need a suitable power source for my creation!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_CONSTRUCT.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_CONSTRUCT.3"
msgid "Good. Use a Phasmo-Encapsulator to capture an entity to power my creation!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_CONSTRUCT_BIGONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_CONSTRUCT_BIGONE.1"
msgid "Finally! Hand over the entity at once!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_CONSTRUCT_BIGONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_CONSTRUCT_BIGONE.2"
msgid "This is the one I've been waiting for! Give it to me now!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_GIVE_GESTALT_CAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_GIVE_GESTALT_CAGE.1"
msgid "Yes! Use this and capture that entity before it escapes!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_GIVE_GESTALT_CAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_GIVE_GESTALT_CAGE.2"
msgid "That's the entity I want! Use this to capture it. Quickly!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_GIVE_GESTALT_CAGE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_GIVE_GESTALT_CAGE.3"
msgid "There it is! Take this and capture that entity now!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_LEVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_LEVER.1"
msgid "Fine work! Now pull the Fulcronial Selector to start the ultimate experiment!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_LEVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_LEVER.2"
msgid "Let us bring my creation to life! Engage the Fulcronial Selector! Yes, yes- the stick-thing."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_LEVER.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_LEVER.3"
msgid "This is it! Pull the Ful- the lever."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_LEVERPULLED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_LEVERPULLED.1"
msgid "It's perfect! Everything is going according to plan."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_LEVERPULLED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_LEVERPULLED.2"
msgid "Eureka! I've done it!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_PEARLMAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_PEARLMAP.1"
msgid "Creatures like that crab are always looking for a bigger home. Let's give her one... sort of."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_PEARLMAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_PEARLMAP.2"
msgid "Perhaps if the crab had a more \"substantial\" island to relocate to, she would leave me alone."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_PEARLMAP.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_PEARLMAP.3"
msgid "Give me a map with an island and we'll see if we can't make it more appealing."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_REVEALBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_REVEALBOSS"
msgid "Behold, my preeminent creation - W.A.R.B.O.T.!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_ROBOTLOSTCONTROL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_ROBOTLOSTCONTROL.1"
msgid "The entity has taken control of W.A.R.B.O.T.."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_ROBOTLOSTCONTROL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_ROBOTLOSTCONTROL.2"
msgid "Seems I underestimated its strength, a shame."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_ROBOTLOSTCONTROL.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_ROBOTLOSTCONTROL.3"
msgid "Ah well. Deal with it, would you?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_SCIONATTACKSWAGSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_SCIONATTACKSWAGSTAFF.1"
msgid "...Gaaah!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_SCIONATTACKSWAGSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_SCIONATTACKSWAGSTAFF.2"
msgid "What's happening to me?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_SCIONATTACKSWAGSTAFF.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_SCIONATTACKSWAGSTAFF.3"
msgid "Impossible!"
msgstr "Niemożliwe!"

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_SCIONATTACKSWAGSTAFF.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_SCIONATTACKSWAGSTAFF.4"
msgid "I don't under..."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_SCIONDOWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_SCIONDOWN.1"
msgid "Very good! The entity is in a weakened state."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_SCIONDOWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_SCIONDOWN.2"
msgid "Now you just need to..."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WAGSTAFF_WAGPUNK_ARENA_SCIONREVEAL.1
